 "notes": "16 first-level units. Gwangju (KR-29) and Jeollanam-do (KR-46) merged into 전남광주통합특별시 (legal short form 광주특별시) on 1 Jul 2026. ISO 3166-2:KR has not been updated (still lists KR-29 and KR-46), so the new unit gets the non-ISO KR-JEONNAM_GWANGJU and both old codes are aliases. No official romanisation has been fixed; latin is a Revised Romanization of the legal name (press uses \"Jeonnam-Gwangju Integrated Special City\"). Input should also accept 광주특별시, 광주광역시 and 전라남도. KR-45: ISO still names it Jeollabuk-do; the official name since 18 Jan 2024 is 전북특별자치도."
